│ both community studies and clinical trials with varying types and severity of urinary incontinence. It is a reliable │
│ and valid measure of HRQOL, suitable for use in a variety of international settings."}, {"study_index": 48, "title": │
│ "Reproducibility of instruments designed to measure subjective evaluation of female stress urinary incontinence",    │
│ "abstract": "The aim of this study was to construct two instruments by which detailed knowledge of women's problems  │
