│ geriatric self‐efficacy index for urinary incontinence", "abstract": "OBJECTIVES To report on the responsiveness     │
│ testing and clinical utility of the 12-item Geriatric Self-Efficacy Index for Urinary Incontinence (GSE-UI). DESIGN  │
